      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule id="9b8caf97-7e7b-52e3-8755-6f781ce00763" name="Polymorphine" hidden="false">
          <description>This model joins an enemy unit during Deployment as if it were friendly. If there is not enough base models for it to join, the owner must kick one of their Independent Characters out of the unit. This model may not be assigned Wounds by any means. In each of your Opponent’s Command Phases they roll 1d6. On a 6 this model is discovered and both units join in Ongoing Melee. This model may choose to reveal itself and both units join in Ongoing Melee during your Command Phase.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="eb5d5d2a-747a-5f44-a2a7-259829978f18" name="Reign of Confusion" hidden="false">
          <description>12” True Aura, enemy units suffers Ld-2. All enemy units within range must test Ld in each of their Command Phases. If they fail, the unit cannot Move, Advance, or Charge this Turn.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
