            <characteristic name="Rules" typeId="989bc79d-9e4b-528b-b966-eff3ce994cc7">Heavy 1, 15” Blast, Destroyer, Ordnance, Monsterbane, Indirect Fire, Ignores Cover, The Hour is Nigh, T Minus 5, One Use Only, Turret, Primary</characteristic>
